{"source":{"key":"en_itani","name":"Talal Itani","translator":"Talal Itani","version":"July 19, 2013","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 3.0","attribution":"Talal Itani · CC BY-NC-ND 3.0 · tanzil.net","url":"https://blog.clearquran.com/about","sort":3,"footnote_count":0},"verses":[{"aya":1,"text":"Woe to every slanderer backbiter.","footnotes":null},{"aya":2,"text":"Who gathers wealth and counts it over.","footnotes":null},{"aya":3,"text":"Thinking that his wealth has made him immortal.","footnotes":null},{"aya":4,"text":"By no means. He will be thrown into the Crusher.","footnotes":null},{"aya":5,"text":"And what will make you realize what the Crusher is?","footnotes":null},{"aya":6,"text":"God's kindled Fire.","footnotes":null},{"aya":7,"text":"That laps to the hearts.","footnotes":null},{"aya":8,"text":"It closes in on them.","footnotes":null},{"aya":9,"text":"In extended columns.","footnotes":null}]}